ProtocolFeeCollector::initialize
├── when the proxy has already been initialized
│   └── it should revert with InvalidInitialization
├── when admin is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when collateral operator is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when pauser is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when DUSD is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when market registry is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when USM registry is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when flash minter is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when treasury is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when manual swap receiver is zero address
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
├── when rewards bps is greater than PERCENTAGE_PRECISION
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorInvalidRewardsBps
├── when minimum reward amount is zero
│   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorInvalidMinimumRewardAmount
└── when all initialization parameters are valid
    ├── it should set admin as owner
    ├── it should set the collateral operator as authorized
    ├── it should authorize the configured pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    ├── it should set admin as a pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    ├── it should set DUSD
    ├── it should set the market registry
    ├── it should set the USM registry
    ├── it should set the flash minter
    ├── it should set the treasury
    ├── it should set the manual swap receiver
    ├── it should leave the sDUSD vault unset
    ├── it should leave PAUSE_TYPE unpaused
    ├── it should set minimumRewardAmount to the provided nonzero value
    ├── it should emit the ownership, role, and configured-address update events
    ├── it should emit MinimumRewardAmountUpdated
    ├── when rewards bps is zero
    │   ├── it should initialize rewardsBps to zero
    │   └── it should not emit RewardsBpsUpdated
    └── when rewards bps is non-zero
        ├── it should set rewardsBps to the provided value
        └── it should emit RewardsBpsUpdated
